{%- comment -%}
  Section: Cart drawer
  Phase 4, Stage 4A. Thin wrapper around snippets/cart-drawer.liquid so the
  drawer has its own section.id and is reachable through the Section
  Rendering API (?section_id=cart-drawer, and the sections= bundling
  parameter on the Ajax Cart endpoints) — groundwork a later AJAX stage
  needs, not used yet in Stage 4A. layout/theme.liquid renders this via the
  static {% section 'cart-drawer' %} tag in place of a direct {% render %}
  call, the same pattern already used there for {% section 'footer' %}. The
  snippet itself still holds all the actual markup, so it stays
  independently reusable/testable.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'cart-drawer' %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cart drawer",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
